{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 13662700997961666935,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Voting Guidelines",
      "source_hash": 8322907984426048656,
      "context_hash": 16530898886277989957,
      "translation": "투표 지침",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:11:47.761431Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Abstract",
      "source_hash": 14205428931693966264,
      "context_hash": 6823538034128843125,
      "translation": "초록",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:11:47.761434Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "This PEP outlines the python-dev voting guidelines.",
      "source_hash": 7723086010372148468,
      "context_hash": 16452732640377109217,
      "translation": "이 PEP는 python-dev의 투표 지침을 설명합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:11:47.761434Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "These guidelines serve to provide feedback or gauge the \"wind direction\" on a particular proposal, idea, or feature.",
      "source_hash": 3898546807236235714,
      "context_hash": 5457288150880553123,
      "translation": "이 지침은 특정 제안, 아이디어, 기능에 대한 피드백을 제공하거나 \"여론의 방향\"을 가늠하는 역할을 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:11:47.761434Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "They don't have a binding force.",
      "source_hash": 10208201955215128517,
      "context_hash": 9385532601522223284,
      "translation": "이 지침은 구속력을 갖지 않습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:11:47.761435Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Rationale",
      "source_hash": 18339363210720796208,
      "context_hash": 1981321520311719656,
      "translation": "근거",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:11:47.761435Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "When a new idea, feature, patch, etc. is floated in the Python community, either through a PEP or on the mailing lists (most likely on python-dev [1]_), it is sometimes helpful to gauge the community's general sentiment.",
      "source_hash": 5976313285436134143,
      "context_hash": 12550013059140987818,
      "translation": "새로운 아이디어, 기능, 패치 등이 PEP를 통해서든 메일링 리스트(대개 python-dev\\ [1]_)를 통해서든 파이썬 커뮤니티에 제기되면, 커뮤니티의 전반적인 의견을 가늠하는 것이 도움이 될 때가 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:11:47.761435Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Sometimes people just want to register their opinion of an idea.",
      "source_hash": 7211500373993398580,
      "context_hash": 9937264677177628214,
      "translation": "때로는 사람들이 단지 어떤 아이디어에 대한 자신의 의견을 표명하고 싶어 할 뿐입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:11:47.761435Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "Sometimes the BDFL wants to take a straw poll.",
      "source_hash": 2994597546287730820,
      "context_hash": 15870959743563910884,
      "translation": "때로는 BDFL이 비공식 여론 조사를 하고자 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:11:47.761436Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:3",
      "source": "Whatever the reason, these guidelines have been adopted so as to provide a common language for developers.",
      "source_hash": 17949101578196587881,
      "context_hash": 11344500670595698147,
      "translation": "이유가 무엇이든, 개발자들에게 공통된 언어를 제공하기 위해 이 지침이 채택되었습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:11:47.761436Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "While opinions are (sometimes) useful, but they are never binding.",
      "source_hash": 14923083304839031228,
      "context_hash": 10976522281313545547,
      "translation": "의견은 (때로는) 유용하지만, 결코 구속력을 갖지는 않습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:11:47.761436Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "Opinions that are accompanied by rationales are always valued higher than bare scores (this is especially true with -1 votes).",
      "source_hash": 16169156824752302286,
      "context_hash": 7931691464625630607,
      "translation": "근거가 함께 제시된 의견은 단순한 점수보다 항상 더 높이 평가됩니다(이는 특히 -1 투표에서 그렇습니다).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:11:47.761437Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Voting Scores",
      "source_hash": 7427876407986724343,
      "context_hash": 5935402356705642513,
      "translation": "투표 점수",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:11:47.761437Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The scoring guidelines are loosely derived from the Apache voting procedure [2]_, with of course our own spin on things.",
      "source_hash": 5440331825016904392,
      "context_hash": 10690637081635866219,
      "translation": "이 채점 지침은 아파치의 투표 절차\\ [2]_\\ 에서 대략적으로 파생되었으며, 물론 우리 나름의 방식이 가미되어 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:11:47.761437Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "There are 4 possible vote scores:",
      "source_hash": 714086624979252252,
      "context_hash": 850549129702455880,
      "translation": "가능한 투표 점수는 4가지입니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:11:47.761437Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "``+1`` I like it",
      "source_hash": 3339630255425314275,
      "context_hash": 15237581652365316796,
      "translation": "``+1`` 마음에 듭니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:11:47.761438Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "``+0`` I don't care, but go ahead",
      "source_hash": 10564932869027122746,
      "context_hash": 7676626569188598030,
      "translation": "``+0`` 상관없지만, 진행하십시오",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:07:52.488629Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "``-0`` I don't care, so why bother?",
      "source_hash": 1213621069375305280,
      "context_hash": 11307356560860794908,
      "translation": "``-0`` 상관없으니, 굳이 그럴 필요가 있습니까?",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:07:52.488632Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "``-1`` I hate it",
      "source_hash": 604043932902000821,
      "context_hash": 13295024459499591374,
      "translation": "``-1`` 마음에 들지 않습니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:07:52.488632Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "You may occasionally see wild flashes of enthusiasm (either for or against) with vote scores like +2, +1000, or -1000.",
      "source_hash": 2515762488793412459,
      "context_hash": 6031734957699784769,
      "translation": "이따금 +2, +1000, -1000과 같은 투표 점수와 함께 (찬성이든 반대든) 격렬한 열정의 분출을 보게 될 수도 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:07:52.488633Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:6/seg:1",
      "source": "These aren't really valued much beyond the above scores, but it's nice to see people get excited about such geeky stuff.",
      "source_hash": 7986880893255020930,
      "context_hash": 2705305950531326263,
      "translation": "이런 점수들은 위의 점수들보다 더 큰 의미를 갖지는 않지만, 사람들이 이런 괴짜스러운 것에 흥분하는 모습을 보는 것은 즐거운 일입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:07:52.488633Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "References",
      "source_hash": 17861670083855418992,
      "context_hash": 10148825178110706749,
